Launcher icon and mascot
  Original artwork created for DLA: the launcher icon is the v1 "Cue" character
  (dark #0A1312 plate, mint terminal body, warm antenna and prompt bar), and the
  in-app mascot art is the same v1 Cue avatar plus the v2 "Ming" beacon used on
  the home screen. No third-party character artwork or icon set is used. The
  mascot proposals under docs/mascot/ are generated from the same original
  artwork and carry the project's Apache-2.0 license.

Bundled renderer assets
  KaTeX 0.16.11 (MIT) — math typesetting; fonts have their own OFL terms.
  mermaid 10.9.1 (MIT) — diagrams.
  Both are shipped under android/app/src/main/assets/renderer/ and served to an
  isolated WebView that has no network access.

